  "@type": "SoftwareSourceCode",
  "identifier": "pdadr",
  "description": "Functions to access and process the microdata of the 2024 District Household Sample Survey of the Federal District of Brazil and its surrounding area (PDAD-A, 'Pesquisa Distrital por Amostra de Domicílios do Distrito Federal e entorno'), published by the Institute for Economic Research and Strategy of the Federal District (IPE/DF) at <https://pdad.ipe.df.gov.br/>. The package ships a complete metadata table (variable and code dictionary) for the household and resident databases, along with functions for dictionary queries, labelling of coded variables, direct reading of the microdata with local caching, weighted estimates and territorial harmonisation with IBGE geographic codes (compatible with Census shapefiles and the 'geobr' package).",
  "name": "pdadr: Access and Processing of the PDAD-A 2024 Microdata",
